WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.033
While visiting Goodra's homeland

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.533
and happily reuniting with many of its old friends,

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.233
Goodra also unhappily reunited with its powerful rival, Florges.

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:17.133
The two engaged in a fierce battle, and Goodra was badly hurt.

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.533
Later that evening...

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.500
Aaah!

7
00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.100
Give back my Pikachu! Stop!

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.300
Aah! Grr!

9
00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:30.200
- Goo...
- No, don't try to get up, Goodra.

10
00:00:30.266 --> 00:00:32.000
You need your rest!

11
00:00:32.066 --> 00:00:33.666
- What?
- Serena, what happened?

12
00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.666
Somebody kidnapped Pikachu, Dedenne and Wooper!

13
00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:39.666
- They just took them away!
- They took them away?

14
00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:42.433
All right! Frogadier, use Water Pulse on Beedrill!

15
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.966
And Fletchinder, cut that net, let's go!

16
00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:46.466
- Froga!
- Fletchinder!

17
00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.933
- Chin!
- Argh!

18
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.666
Oh, no!

19
00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:53.000
-You can't, Goodra.

20
00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:56.366
- You need your rest!
- Dra. Goo!

21
00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.900
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

22
00:00:58.966 --> 00:01:00.733
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

23
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.166
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

24
00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:05.633
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

25
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.466
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

26
00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:12.733
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

27
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.166
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

28
00:01:16.233 --> 00:01:20.133
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

29
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.833
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

30
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.100
♪ Pokémon! ♪

31
00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:33.566
Beyond the Rainbow!

32
00:01:36.166 --> 00:01:37.566
Fletchinder, are you OK?

33
00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:39.000
Froakie!

34
00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:41.533
Ah! Ash!

35
00:01:43.233 --> 00:01:46.333
But... why would they do such a thing? - Goo.

36
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.400
- Goodra. Goo.
- Goodra?

37
00:01:48.466 --> 00:01:51.166
What are you doing? Huh?

38
00:01:51.233 --> 00:01:52.900
Goo? Goodra!

39
00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.033
- Goodra!

40
00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.366
- Come on, Goodra, hang in there!
- Dra. Dra, Goodra...

41
00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:04.533
-Goo! Goodra.

42
00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.833
- We've got to get them back right away!
- Goodra!

43
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.733
Listen, Ash. We saw something while analysing the surveillance videos.

44
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.300
Clemont, what did you see?

45
00:02:12.366 --> 00:02:15.900
- Team Rocket is clearly a part of this!
- I should've known.

46
00:02:15.966 --> 00:02:17.633
Team Rocket?

47
00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.133
They're bad guys who are always up to no good

48
00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.866
and causing trouble by stealing other people's Pokémon.

49
00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:26.333
I wonder if Team Rocket is using Florges and the others.

50
00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:29.500
That sounds like something they'd do!

51
00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:32.566
- Goodra, do you know where Florges is?
- Goo.

52
00:02:32.633 --> 00:02:35.966
- Good. Then lead the way!
- Goodra! Goo...

53
00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.933
- Hold on, Clemont.
- Huh?

54
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:41.300
Something's bothering me. I'll catch up after I look into it.

55
00:02:41.366 --> 00:02:43.633
For now, just make sure you stay safe.

56
00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.166
I understand.

57
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:49.366
Pika!

58
00:02:49.433 --> 00:02:50.700
- Denne-ne!
- Wooper!

59
00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:04.033
- Florges...
- Florges, please tell us.

60
00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:06.500
What's the status of your dear Floette?

61
00:03:08.566 --> 00:03:12.333
The water level's goin' down, right? Is that what you're tryin' to tell us?

62
00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.566
So Floette's not gettin' enough of the water's healin' effect.

63
00:03:15.633 --> 00:03:17.266
- Ges.
- None of this would've happened

64
00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:19.100
if it weren't for what that Goodra did!

65
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:20.833
Florges.

66
00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.533
Goodra wants to chase you all out of the wetlands

67
00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.433
and keep them for its friends.

68
00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.066
That's why it came back with reinforcements, like those twerp Pokémon.

69
00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:30.466
Pika, pika!

70
00:03:30.533 --> 00:03:32.300
- Denne-ne!
- Wooper!

71
00:03:32.366 --> 00:03:37.533
Liar, liar, Pokémon pants on fire. The jig is up, so come clean for a change!

72
00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.466
Wobba, wobba!

73
00:03:39.533 --> 00:03:43.566
Don't worry. We're on your side, Florges, and we're here one hundred per cent.

74
00:03:43.633 --> 00:03:47.500
Yup! We'll have your Floette feeling fit as a fiddle before you can say boo!

75
00:03:47.566 --> 00:03:51.400
Right. Fret not. Those timid Twerps wouldn't dare make a single move

76
00:03:51.466 --> 00:03:53.733
as long as we've got them under lock and key.

77
00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.033
Pikachu!

78
00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.733
- Denne-ne-ne!
- Wooper!

79
00:04:04.466 --> 00:04:09.133
Just as I suspected. The healing effect of the water has gotten quite weak.

80
00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:10.133
Bellsprout, sprout, sprout.

81
00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:14.066
We'd better go check up on the source of the spring.

82
00:04:14.133 --> 00:04:14.966
Bellsprout!

83
00:04:19.533 --> 00:04:20.899
-Goo!

84
00:04:20.966 --> 00:04:23.900
Now hold on. We're not here to start a fight, OK?

85
00:04:23.966 --> 00:04:26.466
We want Pikachu and the other Pokémon back!

86
00:04:26.533 --> 00:04:29.000
We know Team Rocket's around here somewhere.

87
00:04:29.066 --> 00:04:32.166
They're the bad guys! Don't let them fool you!

88
00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:36.200
Please stop! You've gotta believe us!

89
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.533
-Goo, goo.

90
00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.833
- It's no use.
- But we've gotta do something!

91
00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:47.533
Chespin, Bunnelby, come out! Use Vine Whip and Mud Shot, let's go!

92
00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.333
- Bunnelby!
- Chespin!

93
00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.433
Ches!

94
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:54.133
We'll help too! Braixen, use Flamethrower!

95
00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.866
Braixen!

96
00:04:55.933 --> 00:04:58.033
- Go! We'll distract them!
- Yeah!

97
00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.866
- Good.
- I'm coming with you!

98
00:05:00.933 --> 00:05:03.133
Braix!

99
00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.700
Hey, over here!

100
00:05:04.766 --> 00:05:08.866
Chespin and Bunnelby! Focus and let's take care of this!

101
00:05:13.766 --> 00:05:18.000
- Pikachu!
- Dedenne! Wooper! Where are you?

102
00:05:18.066 --> 00:05:19.633
So are the three of them here?

103
00:05:21.033 --> 00:05:22.200
- Huh?
- Goo?

104
00:05:24.266 --> 00:05:26.700
- Florges, it's you!
- Where's Dedenne?

105
00:05:26.766 --> 00:05:28.200
Florges.

106
00:05:28.266 --> 00:05:30.700
I'll bet Team Rocket put you up to this, didn't they?

107
00:05:30.766 --> 00:05:33.933
Trying to take over. Can't you see they're all really bad guys?

108
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.133
He's right! They're not telling you the truth!

109
00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.100
Ges, flor, flor, ges!

110
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:39.000
Huh?

111
00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:44.666
The water's really low. Maybe that's why it's mad.

112
00:05:44.733 --> 00:05:47.000
Do you actually think we're responsible for that?

113
00:05:47.066 --> 00:05:48.700
- Ges.
- You're wrong!

114
00:05:48.766 --> 00:05:50.433
We had nothing to do with any of that!

115
00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.133
- Huh?
- Dra, goo?

116
00:05:55.466 --> 00:05:57.733
Floette. The Single Bloom Pokémon,

117
00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.333
and the evolved form of Flabébé.

118
00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.033
Floette appear in flower gardens

119
00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:03.633
to welcome new blooms with a graceful dance.

120
00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:06.466
- You're caring for it?
- Floette looks like it's sick.

121
00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.166
- Ges, ges!
- Huh?

122
00:06:10.233 --> 00:06:13.133
- Hey, what's going on?
- Look at the water!

123
00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.533
- Ges?
- Seviper!

124
00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:18.900
Clemont? Do you know what's happening?

125
00:06:18.966 --> 00:06:21.000
- Up there!
- Huh?

126
00:06:24.333 --> 00:06:25.666
- Huh?
- Where'd all the water go?

127
00:06:25.733 --> 00:06:26.733
-Dra?

128
00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.400
Prepare for trouble, it's running dry!

129
00:06:29.466 --> 00:06:31.733
And make it double, cos we know why!

130
00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:34.233
To protect the world from devastation!

131
00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:36.933
To unite all people within our nation!

132
00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.933
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

133
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.600
To extend our reach to the stars above!

134
00:06:43.666 --> 00:06:45.300
- Jessie!
- And James.

135
00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:48.933
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

136
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.766
Surrender now or prepare for a thirsty fight!

137
00:06:51.833 --> 00:06:55.400
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

138
00:06:56.533 --> 00:06:58.466
- Pikachu!
- Dedenne!

139
00:06:58.533 --> 00:07:00.366
- Pika, pi!
- Dedenne!

140
00:07:00.433 --> 00:07:02.233
So it was you after all!

141
00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:04.933
I'm actually quite impressed that you figured out

142
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.233
we were the ones who were manipulating Florges.

143
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:12.666
My brother figured it out. He knew you were the ones who attacked Goodra, too!

144
00:07:12.733 --> 00:07:15.900
- So the missing water was your doing!
- Perceptive.

145
00:07:15.966 --> 00:07:18.766
We not only stole every last drop from the spring,

146
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:20.366
but from the entire wetlands!

147
00:07:20.433 --> 00:07:21.533
-Yeah, you would.

148
00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.966
I'm so very sorry, Florges. I have to confess

149
00:07:25.033 --> 00:07:29.033
the reason Floette hasn't been feeling quite up to par lately is Team Rocket.

150
00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.533
Why are you doing this?

151
00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:33.200
You twerps are as clueless as they come, aren't you?

152
00:07:33.266 --> 00:07:37.266
Florges took control of the water because Floette is feeling under the weather.

153
00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:41.833
Aw, touching! Makes you want to break down and cry, doesn't it?

154
00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.533
- But we took it all for us instead!
- Goo!

155
00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:48.333
Water that can heal the minds and bodies of Pokémon is worth a fortune,

156
00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.433
and we're fortunate to steal it, dig?

157
00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:51.766
Wobbuffet!

158
00:07:51.833 --> 00:07:54.733
How evil can you get?

159
00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.466
- Florges!
- Us? You're quite the chump.

160
00:07:57.533 --> 00:08:00.300
Fooling a naïve Pokémon like you was a piece of cake.

161
00:08:00.366 --> 00:08:02.800
And man, did that piece of cake taste good!

162
00:08:02.866 --> 00:08:05.033
Flor!

163
00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:06.966
Calm down!

164
00:08:07.033 --> 00:08:09.133
-Pika, pika!

165
00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:11.200
Ah, but wait, there's much more!

166
00:08:11.266 --> 00:08:14.133
We've got your friends!

167
00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.133
- Clemont! Serena!
- Huh?

168
00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:18.933
- Are you OK?
- Keanan!

169
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.966
I need to know where Team Rocket is.

170
00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.133
- Hey, that sound!
- What is it?

171
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.799
-What's that?

172
00:08:37.266 --> 00:08:38.866
Team Rocket, come back!

173
00:08:38.933 --> 00:08:40.066
- Ash!
- Huh?

174
00:08:40.133 --> 00:08:42.166
So it was Team Rocket after all!

175
00:08:42.233 --> 00:08:44.866
That means we know what's inside their plane!

176
00:08:44.933 --> 00:08:48.433
Pikachu and the others! They must have the stolen water, too!

177
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.033
- You mean they took all of it?
- Mm-hm.

178
00:08:51.100 --> 00:08:53.933
And Florges and all its friends took control of the spring

179
00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.300
because Floette's really sick and needs help!

180
00:08:56.366 --> 00:08:59.866
Huh? Is that true?

181
00:08:59.933 --> 00:09:03.366
So Florges did all of this so Floette could finally get well.

182
00:09:05.066 --> 00:09:08.800
Goodra! Let's take back that water!

183
00:09:08.866 --> 00:09:10.400
- Get me up there!
- Goo!

184
00:09:10.466 --> 00:09:14.866
- Goo, goo!
- Whoa!

185
00:09:16.566 --> 00:09:17.933
Florges.

186
00:09:24.233 --> 00:09:25.166
Uh! Florges?

187
00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:28.866
Ges, ges!

188
00:09:28.933 --> 00:09:31.366
Florges, I'm really glad you came to help!

189
00:09:31.433 --> 00:09:32.600
Ge, Ge.

190
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:38.033
Goodra!

191
00:09:39.066 --> 00:09:41.700
-Goo!

192
00:09:45.266 --> 00:09:47.000
Goodra!

193
00:09:47.066 --> 00:09:48.733
Goo! Goo!

194
00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:51.933
Looks like we have unwelcome guests on board.

195
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.866
All right. Then simply throw them off.

196
00:09:53.933 --> 00:09:56.466
- Yeah.
- Wobba, Wobba!

197
00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:03.866
Who's that Pokémon?

198
00:10:08.166 --> 00:10:10.600
It's Florges!

199
00:10:10.666 --> 00:10:12.333
Florges.

200
00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:18.600
- Huh?

201
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:21.833
Goodra!

202
00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.300
Huh?

203
00:10:25.366 --> 00:10:28.533
- Wow, nice job, Goodra!
- Goodra! Goodra!

204
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.166
- Annoying brats!

205
00:10:32.233 --> 00:10:34.766
I'm sealing off the corridor in Area E.

206
00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:37.333
We can't just ignore them, so what do you recommend?

207
00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:40.166
Educate them! Teach them a lesson and give them the boot!

208
00:10:40.233 --> 00:10:43.700
Like this. Switchin' to autopilot while we deal with this.

209
00:10:43.766 --> 00:10:45.033
Wob, Wobbuffet!

210
00:10:46.766 --> 00:10:48.033
Huh?

211
00:10:50.033 --> 00:10:52.066
-Now what?

212
00:10:53.666 --> 00:10:56.100
Goo!

213
00:10:56.166 --> 00:10:58.833
- Goodra!
- Thanks, Goodra!

214
00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.900
Flor, Flor.

215
00:11:02.133 --> 00:11:04.900
- Man, that was a close one.
- Goo.

216
00:11:04.966 --> 00:11:06.400
Huh?

217
00:11:06.466 --> 00:11:09.533
-Now don't worry, you guys!

218
00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.500
I'll get you out of there!

219
00:11:12.566 --> 00:11:14.933
- I think not.
- Not you again!

220
00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.466
Hanging out with the twerpish crowd, I see.

221
00:11:17.533 --> 00:11:19.800
Your usefulness has long since expired.

222
00:11:19.866 --> 00:11:21.533
Flor, Florges, flor, flor!

223
00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:24.666
Boo-hoo. You're mad that we pulled the wool over your eyes

224
00:11:24.733 --> 00:11:26.600
and now you want all your water back.

225
00:11:26.666 --> 00:11:29.066
It's not our fault that you're a fool.

226
00:11:29.133 --> 00:11:32.833
Acting like some sort of royalty? Well, not any more!

227
00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.133
Pikachu stays with us! Inkay! Let's play!

228
00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.733
You too, Pumpkaboo!

229
00:11:38.933 --> 00:11:40.700
- Inkay, Inkay!
- Pumpkaboo, boo!

230
00:11:40.766 --> 00:11:43.666
- Hey! You sure you're feeling up to this?
- Goodra.

231
00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.533
- Goo.
- Ge.

232
00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.766
All right, Goodra and Florges, it's time to save Pikachu!

233
00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.800
Oh, Ash...

234
00:11:54.866 --> 00:11:57.566
Pumpkaboo! Show Florges your Shadow Ball!

235
00:11:57.633 --> 00:11:59.833
Ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-boo!

236
00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.833
Florges!

237
00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.800
- Kaboo!
- Flor, flor!

238
00:12:04.866 --> 00:12:07.766
Now! Inkay, use Psybeam on Florges!

239
00:12:08.866 --> 00:12:11.466
Inkay!

240
00:12:11.533 --> 00:12:13.333
Goo! Goodra!

241
00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.800
- Goodra!
- Goodra, no!

242
00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:16.566
Pika, pika!

243
00:12:16.633 --> 00:12:20.000
Hey! Goodra. you're still not fully healed from before!

244
00:12:20.066 --> 00:12:23.533
Which gives Pumpkaboo the chance to use Dark Pulse on Goodra.

245
00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:25.100
While Inkay uses Psybeam!

246
00:12:25.166 --> 00:12:29.233
Inkay! Ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-ka-boo!

247
00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.633
Are you OK?

248
00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.300
Well, that's a big relief!

249
00:12:42.366 --> 00:12:44.133
